# the assembler of the mach toolchain, as a library
#
# this is masc's one declared public list: every module a dependent imports is
# forwarded here, and every other module of src is internal to masc and may
# change without notice. a dependent imports a module by its own path, so the
# list is held by review, as nothing in the build enforces it. a module joins
# the list when a dependent first imports it and leaves it when the last one
# stops, and a change to a module on the list carries a Consumer changes
# section naming its downstream port.

